      "Design the structured memory schema in detail, including example JSON records.",
      "Explain how the memory schema can remain consistent across different foundation models.",
      "Design the interaction-to-training-data pipeline and explain how to distinguish successful developer behaviour from rejected AI suggestions.",
      "Design BM25 and semantic retrieval as an integrated memory retrieval system.",
      "Explain how retrieved context should be selected, ranked and passed to the foundation model.",
      "Explain how memory and LoRA complement each other without duplicating responsibilities.",
      "Design an evaluation framework that measures the individual and combined contribution of all components.",
      "Recommend technologies based on practical compatibility, privacy, performance and maintainability.",
      "Identify dependencies and the correct implementation sequence.",
      "Avoid recommending multiple simultaneously hosted large models.",
      "Avoid introducing unnecessary infrastructure or complex distributed systems."
    ],
    "required_response_structure": [
      {
        "section": 1,
        "title": "Understanding of the Project",
        "requirement": "Summarise the objective and explain the four pillars in your own words."
      },
      {
        "section": 2,
        "title": "Critical Review",
        "requirement": "Identify assumptions, missing components, technical risks and opportunities to improve the proposed direction."
      },
      {
        "section": 3,
        "title": "Recommended Architecture",
        "requirement": "Provide a complete modular architecture and explain how all components communicate."
      },
      {
        "section": 4,
        "title": "LoRA Personalisation Architecture",
        "requirement": "Explain interaction collection, behavioural extraction, dataset generation, LoRA optimisation, training, adapter management and versioning."
      },
      {
        "section": 5,
        "title": "Memory Architecture",
        "requirement": "Define the exact structured memory schema, memory categories, extraction process, update logic and storage strategy."
      },
      {
        "section": 6,
        "title": "Retrieval Architecture",
        "requirement": "Design BM25, semantic retrieval, metadata filtering, reranking and context construction."
      },
      {
        "section": 7,
        "title": "Foundation Model Strategy",
        "requirement": "Compare Qwen, Gemma, Nemotron and other suitable candidates. Explain local deployment, compatibility and model switching."
      },
      {
        "section": 8,
        "title": "Evaluation Framework",
        "requirement": "Define benchmarks, metrics, controlled experiments and approval gates."
      },
      {
        "section": 9,
        "title": "Technology Stack",
        "requirement": "Recommend specific open-source libraries, frameworks, runtimes, storage systems and training tools, explaining why each is suitable."
      },
      {
        "section": 10,
        "title": "Implementation Roadmap",
        "requirement": "Provide a phased development plan with dependencies, milestones and expected deliverables."
      },
      {
        "section": 11,
